  "contentHtml": "<div>\r\n<div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"BORDER-TOP: rgb(254,137,67) 3px double; BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(254,137,67) 3px double; BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(254,137,67) 3px double; PADDING-BOTTOM: 10px; PADDING-TOP: 10px; PADDING-LEFT: 10px; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(254,137,67) 3px double; PADDING-RIGHT: 10px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(254,222,199)\">\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조\">가</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조\">전시 수업내용 확인 및 학습 동기 유발</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조\">전시에 배운 힘에 대해 이야기해보고 모든 물체에는 한 가지 종류의 힘만 작용하는 것이 아니라 두 개 이상의 힘이 작용함을 알아본다</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조\">번지점프 탈 때 중력과 탄성력의 작용에 의해 아래로 떨어지기도 하고 위로 올라가는 과정을 보여준 후</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조\">힘의 합성에 의한 알짜힘에 대해 알아본다</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조\">그리고 그 힘에 의한 운동을 표현하는 방법에 대한 학습동기 유발을 위하여 속력에 관련된 동영상을 본다</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조\">빠르기란 무엇인가 생각해보는 시간을 갖는다</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp; </p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조\">나</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조\">배움 활동</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">1 (</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조\">속도의 개념 파악</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조\">거북이와 토끼의 경주에서 순간속력과 평균속력의 개념을 알아보는 시간을 갖는다</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조\">속력을 측정하는 방법으로 기록타이머의 종이테이프를 이용하는 방법을 알아보고 그 테이프의 타점 간격으로 운동을 분석하는 시간을 갖는다</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp; </p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조\">다</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조\">배움활동</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">2(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조\">시간</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">-</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조\">속력</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조\">시간</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">-</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조\">거리 그래프 그리기</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조\">종이테이프의 타점 간격간의 거리를 측정하여 시간</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">-</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조\">속력</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조\">시간</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">-</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조\">거리 그래프를 그리는 활동을 한다</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조\">그러한 운동분석을 통하여 가속운동</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조\">등속운동</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조\">감속운동의 특징을 말할 수 있도록 한다</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조\">또한 실생활에서의 여러 가지 운동과 접목하여 운동을 분석한다</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조\">종이테이프 대신에는 롤 휴지를 사용하여 같은 시간의 이동거리를 분석하였다</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-fami